DD-Turnip-Emu-v1.0.0

Turnip, the Mesa freedreno Vulkan driver, built from Mesa 27.0.0-devel at edce88a39ed49284ad18b2745eb1b592fd5d0440
with the DD-Turnip patch set, for Android emulators that load Adrenotools drivers.

Source: DD-Turnip-v1.0.0-source.tar.xz, published with these drivers at https://github.com/Droid-Deck/Drivers/releases/tag/DD-Turnip-v1.0.0
It holds Mesa at that commit (mesa/) and the patches and build scripts that produced them (drivers/).

